  "short_description": "一款充滿創意、腳踏實地、無拘無束的城市建造遊戲。精心打造一座城市設計的傑作，一個可持續發展的小鎮，或是一座未來主義的大都市。藉助程序化生成的建築、無網格的自由分區和強大的編輯器工具，遊戲中的一切皆可定製：這座城市，由你做主。",
  "short_description_en": "The creative, pragmatic, limitless city builder. Engineer a masterpiece of urban design, a small sustainable town or a futuristic metropolis. With procedurally generated buildings, grid-less zoning and powerful editor tools, everything is customizable: the city is yours.",
